    "description": "Hyman Products, Inc.\nAuthentic Berlin Wall and Lava Rock Lot\nVintage, 1989\nThis commemorative set features authentic segments including a piece of the Berlin Wall, preserved following the historic events of late 1989. The lot includes the original presentation box, a velvet drawstring pouch, an informative historical booklet, and a formal Declaration of Origin document. These artifacts represent a significant turning point in 20th-century history, documenting the transition from the Cold War to German reunification.\nITEMS INCLUDED:\n1.\nBerlin Wall Segment\n- Authentic concrete cut with visible aggregate, originated in East Germany\n2.\nLava Rock Piece\n- Naturally textured specimen as identified in collection records\n3.\nDocumentation\n- Original 1989 Declaration of Origin and historical booklet\n4.\nPresentation Materials\n- Original Hyman Products box and burgundy velvet drawstring pouch\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. Rock specimens are intact with natural textures. Documentation and booklet are well-preserved with minor age-toning. The original cardboard box shows light shelf wear and a partial surface tear near the barcode area. Velvet pouch is clean and functional.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
